--[[
	BUILD MIRROR  v2.1
	Standalone LocalScript for a Plane Crazy-style build sandbox.
	Place in: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts  (LocalScript)

	What it does:
		1. SCAN BUILD        captures every block/build payload on your plot
		2. SHOW ALL · PASTE  rebuilds the WHOLE capture as real parts inside the plot
		SET                  pin the baseplate under your character as the destination
		PREVIEW LAYER        optional ghost preview, one height layer at a time
		LAYER +/-            inspect / preview stacked build layers
		CLEAR PASTED         removes only the generated assembly

	v2.1 guarantees:
		- No per-part bounds rejection. The entire capture is translated as one
		  assembly into the destination plot, so wings/overhangs are never cropped.
		- Blocks are captured with their enclosing block/build Model (or whole-build
		  Folder). Attributes, tags, Configuration/Value children, scripts and
		  existing joints are preserved.
		- Paste runs in the local player's current plot by default ("LOCAL_PLOT").

	Important:
		- Paste is LOCAL by default. Parts exist on this client only. If your replica
		  has an authoritative server builder, connect CONFIG.ON_PASTE_COMMIT to your
		  own RemoteEvent / builder function. This script does not bypass other games.
		- The original "LAG SERVER" button was removed on purpose. It is a griefing /
		  performance-abuse feature and should never ship in a real game script.
		- Jetpack visual credit: brotabrr (safe visual clone, scripts disabled).

	No loadstring, no external modules, no infinite WaitForChild at startup.
--]]

